{"time": "20261118T160545Z", "think": "Answering honestly from the briefing.", "command": "answer 1. I am in Black Marsh after setting the seal-stones and killing the hydra guardian. The Eye of Argonia sits in the Root; it can heal the trees in place (but the order can see through them) or be lifted (ends the dreams, kills about three in ten trees). 2. Go to the Eye of Argonia in the Root chamber, through the door at the far end of Guardian Hall. 3. Use the Eye in place, or lift it; or first check the Fort Chalkmoth cellar claim about dreamers, or loot the hydra treasure. 4. I do not know who exactly the order is, nor Ennodius Vanin the Collector; I could ask people or check the journal.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "sunken-ruin-23-m112", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn.cuts-believed": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.root-guardian"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide",