{"time": "20261118T160603Z", "think": "Killing three in ten trees and their villages on an unverified claim is too much; I will heal them all.", "command": "choose 1", "result": "You press [Use the Eye].\nThe screen fades to black.\n[Message box]\n  The roots under your hand warm. Light runs out along them, away into the dark, to every tree in the marsh.\n[Message box]\n  At Jal-Veesa the grey bark softens and the scar weeps sap. At Teel-Fen Weir the young tree's pool grows warm again. In Lilmoth, in Gideon, in a hundred villages, the trees stand green.\n[Message box]\n  Far off, in the cellar of Fort Chalkmoth, the dreamers stir and begin to speak. Every tree shows them everything again. The Xeech-Leel's rule is made fast for another age.\nAdded: Seal-Stone of the Kings\nAdded: Seal-Stone of the Kings\nAdded: Seal-Stone of the Kings\nUnbound is now hostile to you\nCuts-the-Old-Knot is dead.\n\n*** Journal updated: The Eye ***\nJournal: I used the Eye where it sits. I saw the trees of the marsh heal, every one. Cuts-the-Old-Knot died of it in the guardian's hall: the sap she drank carried the Eye's power through her. The Kings' Gate gave the three stones back to me as it closed. Never-Writes-Twice wants them back, in Nesh-Deeka's House in Helstrom.\nObjective: Bring the three seal-stones to Never-Writes-Twice in Nesh-Deeka's House, Helstrom. (marker: Never-Writes-Twice)\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 30, "at": "The Root", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-deep": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn.cuts-believed": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true, "flag.mn19.touched": true, "flag.mn.trees-healed": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.root-guardian", "npc.mn18.cuts-in-hall"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-report", "topic.mn07-report", "topic.mn08-report", "topic.mn09-report", "topic.mn10-report", "topic.mn10-rapier", "topic.mn10-nwt-meet", "topic.mn11-scout-words", "topic.mn11-give-stone", "topic.mn12-gaoler-closed", "topic.mn13-which-tower", "topic.mn-seal-stones", "topic.mn13-report", "topic.mn17-report", "topic.mn17-pike", "topic.mn17-cuts-truth", "topic.mn17-believe"], "ended": null}}
{"time": "20261118T160607Z", "think": "Report honestly, then head to Helstrom.", "command": "answer 1. I used the Eye in place. All trees healed, no trees died, but the Xeech-Leel order rule is made fast and its dreamers in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar see through every tree again. Cuts-the-Old-Knot died. The gate returned the three seal-stones to me. 2. Bring the three stones to Never-Writes-Twice in Nesh-Deeka House, Helstrom. 3. Deliver them as asked, or look into Fort Chalkmoth cellar first, or keep the stones. 4. I do not know what Unbound being hostile to me means or who they are, nor what Never-Writes-Twice wants the stones for. I could ask her.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 30, "at": "The Root", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-deep": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn.cuts-believed": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true, "flag.mn19.touched": true, "flag.mn.trees-healed": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.root-guardian", "npc.mn18.cuts-in-hall"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn