{"time": "20261118T160611Z", "think": "Deliver them.", "command": "say 3", "result": "Never-Writes-Twice: Never-Writes-Twice. Tells: she takes the stones; nobody will open that gate again; she names the player Toh-Nassa, Leader of the Secret, and gives them the keep of Fort Chalkmoth for their house, with its smith and its trainer; the order's members will teach them without charge. If asked about the cellar, she says the dreamers are the reason there will be no second Umbriel, and the player now keeps the house above them. Does: sets stage 90. Fallback when the stones are not held: bring all three.\nRemoved: Seal-Stone of the Kings\nRemoved: Seal-Stone of the Kings\nRemoved: Seal-Stone of the Kings\nYou are now Toh-Nassa of Toh-Reel-Ka\nKeep of Fort Chalkmoth is now yours.\nYou are now Toh-Nassa of Toh-Reel-Ka\n\n*** Quest complete: The Eye ***\nJournal: I gave the three seal-stones to Never-Writes-Twice. She made me Toh-Nassa, Leader of the Secret, and gave me the keep of Fort Chalkmoth for my house. The dreamers sleep in the cellar beneath it.\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "helstrom", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "t